  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DBP Alam Group and Scale Biofuels</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the partnership is to develop and establish production of bioethanol which can be applied as cooking fuel based on waste biomass from sugar production (blackstrap molasses) in Kaliro district in Eastern Uganda. The long term objective is to also apply the bioethanol in the transportation sector.</narrative>
  </description>
